   110	- JD-S6 `type = "binary"` on every criterion (script J4). A quality judgement is split into yes/no criteria, each naming one decidable fact.
   111	- JD-S7 Every `weight` is an integer in {1, 3, 5, -1, -3, -5} (script J5). Floats (`3.0`), zero and other magnitudes fail. The sign is the only polarity marker.
