    62	
    63	Review every file in the bundle - both Dockerfiles, test.sh, solve.sh, solve.py, test_output.py, and every file under environment/ - as hostile until proven clean. The verifier and the agent both run as root, and reviewers run bundles on their own machines, so all bundle files are trust surface.
    64	
