master_chat_tasks/knowledge/QC_FIX_PLAYBOOK_v3.md:82:1. Before any fix: record for each lever the points lost when the reference plays that lever's wrong reading alone (the single-lever table of STACKING_CHECK (d); variants in `WORK/wrong/` or the harden OUT folder). If no variants exist, write each as a copy of solve.py with exactly that one wrong reading, and measure on the unfixed tests in the same session.
