master_chat_tasks/knowledge/QC_RULINGS.md:5:How to use: later designs reuse what QC accepted (PASS rows, REUSE) and avoid what it rejected (FAIL/MINOR/WARN rows, AVOID). Build, harden and fix sessions read this before writing `WORK/QC_DEFENCE.md`. The master appends one row per new P11 ruling on these 9 rules (P12 v2 lists them in its `QC_RULINGS rows` section).
