master_chat_tasks/knowledge/QC_RULINGS.md:31:Test: both (1) the sentence announces a property, edge case or branch the agent was meant to find, and (2) the shipped input already establishes it. The reviewer must name the discovery and point to the input (01:47); checklist 01:87 "name both the discovery and the input that carries it, or raise nothing". Exempt: rules of engagement, CL-6 signposts, IN-16 settlers, DS-25 literals, finished-work shape, orientation. Our scan (QC_PUSH_REVIEW s4, INFERRED): 9 strong or moderate hits, match-replay M-2..M-5, M-1, M-7; caldermoor C-1, C-2; sentinel S-2.
