master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:111:Legality: no doc lever is illegal as written. The doc itself bans hidden conventions (lines 300-305, 389) and requires DS-21. Its two strongest examples, however, rest partly on tasks our rules call holes:
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:118:## 4. New lever candidates
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:119:- **N1. Pair the two channels (held-out w5 tier + probe band).**
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:124:  - Our gate runs show the mirror image: probe band rubric 0-25 but tests 73-85, best 40.48.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:126:  - Proof: on frozen QC-passed bytes, 1 valid run with tests <= 60 and rubric <= 20, and 3 fresh blind reads with tests <= 60, losses WRONG or v3.5 hidden-scale.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:127:- **N2. Held-out weight-5 share of at least 50% (the dial for L2).**
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:134:Under-weighted by the doc, already in our rules: P-5 probe band (judge), P-3 hidden larger instances (42e79476 is our dispatch at 14.7), and the S3 unique-fit habit (18b5d99f).
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:136:## 5. Gate < 40 recommendation
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:137:- Arithmetic: final < 40 means tests + rubric < 80 (s08 O4). At our gate-run test levels (73-85), the rubric would have to be 7 or below, down to -5, which a legal judge does not reach (the probe band gives 0-25). Our 10 valid gate runs: 1 below 40 (dispatch 14.7, tests 35.64), 4 below 50, mean tests 78.7, mean rubric 23.5.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:144:  - The working design target should be **tests <= 60 with rubric <= 20** (N1). Any tests figure of 65 or more needs rubric <= 15 and leaves no variance margin (±10 final).
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:147:## 6. What is new vs our prior studies
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:155:Already known: unseen inputs × whole-unit exactness drive separation (DL:47-56 TD1-TD3 = doc L2+L4), the degenerate shipped instance (S2), the probe band (SUMMARY item 3), honesty negatives over figure criteria (item 4), wrong-reading test negatives never fire (DL:54 TD8; doc's 2 of 525), variance ±20 (G13), and the hole tasks.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:161:- (4) The held-out w5 share threshold (N2).
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:162:- (5) Our probe-band tasks hold 4 of the 10 lowest judge halves in the delivered set, independent confirmation of P-5.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:168:## 7. Questions
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:171:2. Adopt N1 + N2 as the default build shape (Shape D with held-out w5 share >= 50% plus the probe band) for the next pilot? Recommended: yes, one pilot first, judged by the N1 proof bar.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:177:6. What exact rule did section 3 use for the theme regexes and the "plumbing passes, exact fails" signature (24/15)? Recommended: publish the script so the counts can be reproduced.
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:181:## Lessons for the master
master_chat_work/20261028_upgrade/R3_hardness_md/FINDINGS.md:183:- Held-out w5 weight (L2/N2) and the probe band (L6/P-5) are the two proven levers in both data sets. Everything else is an amplifier or weak.
