    29	## 0b. The determinate test (05:21-32; also decides IN-17, TS-19, JD-15)
    30	A deliverable-property rule needs no sentence when the shipped input (any directory `environment/Dockerfile` copies) DETERMINES it: the agent can read it off the input, and the input contradicts every wrong reading (05:21 "rather than something the input merely fails to contradict").
    31	- Counts: a present data property (3 of 40 rows carry an empty timestamp, 05:26); a config value (`fiscal_start = "04-01"`, 05:29); an example actually given, for output shape and types (FC:492, 04:95); a listed candidate set; a record that only the right reading reproduces.
    32	- Never counts: silence (every shipped id distinct says nothing about repeats, 05:27); pre-formatted values (they show the width, not the rounding rule, 05:28); a branch that never fires on shipped data; readings that coincide on shipped data; any prohibition or scope rule (05:30, 03:50). These need a stated sentence.
    33	- [v3: degenerate instance is only legal with a sentence, g1 GS:23, g1/C_3f39299a.md:34] A degenerate shipped instance therefore always needs the rule sentence for every branch it hides. The instance may hide the case; it may never hide the rule.
    34	- One file settles one demand (05:32): judge the exact fact the check needs, not the file.
    35	- Rules of engagement (scope, which files may change, tools, procedural order, negatives) are always stated (IN-15 01:45; AL-1 carve-out 05:21). Shape and literals of the output may be settled by a shipped example (05:21 constraint exception, FC:492).
    36	- Every rule settled by evidence gets a row in `WORK/EVIDENCE_MAP.md`: `| rule | test ids | shipped fact file:line | wrong readings it contradicts |` (FC:428 "name either the sentence it enforces or the shipped fact it reads").
    37	- [v3: g2 GS:47-58, 3def42a3 TRUTH.md:423-461] Every stated rule gets a row in `WORK/RULE_TRACE.md`: `| rule id | sentence file:line | generator branch that plants it | tests that grade it |`. A generator branch with no sentence row is a hidden rule: delete the branch or write the sentence.
