master_chat_tasks/prompts/templates/P2_build_v5.md:120:- No trap explanations, no rule counts, no lists of pitfalls (W1). IN-17 self-check on every sentence: if it announces something the agent was meant to find AND the shipped input already establishes it, delete it.
master_chat_tasks/prompts/templates/P2_build_v5.md:121:- Include "You have N seconds to complete this task." with N equal to `[agent] timeout_sec`, and keep the online-lookup sentence.
master_chat_tasks/prompts/templates/P2_build_v5.md:127:- Include the positive weight total, the named negatives and the current sha256 values. Write every sha256 and every figure from a script run after your last edit under `tests/` or `solution/` (DS-22: 5 of 90 fails); precheck.sh recomputes each `<name>: <sha256>` line and fails a mismatch.
