master_chat_tasks/prompts/templates/P2_build_v5.md:156:Final reply (common rule, 10 lines max): DONE, BLOCKED or PILOT WEAK; levers and where each rule is written; check and criterion counts; weight shares; PRECHECK last line; stacking result; oracle; open conflicts; report path. Next step (v5 order): master issues 3 fresh P13 blind reads (the round counts only if they lose >= 10% of positive test points by WRONG output; each reports a judge estimate; redesign, never park, if the lower-bound final is above 70 on 2 of 3), then one full QC (P11 v3 MODE full) with a fix-all pass, QC recheck rounds, freeze, then 1 harness run on the frozen bytes.
