master_chat_tasks/knowledge/LEVER_RULES_v3.md:23:[v3: our 24-26 Oct builds, registry/tasks.json] Our 8 parked builds 24-26 Oct were small, fully stated contracts with a computational core. Blind Opus sessions transliterated them into exact programs in about 3 minutes (cleanroom 3/3 at 98/98, crash-recovery 3/3 at 95/95, batch-lease 3/3 at 139/139), and stated limits handed over the fast exact method (cold-chain probe tests 100, final 85.0; flood: 2 of 3 found the DP in about 5 minutes). Exact optimum with a stated method is easy for Opus (g4/C_80877080.md:9: solved exactly on 9 corpora in 24 minutes).
