master_chat_tasks/knowledge/LEVER_RULES_v3.md:60:Never used. (a) Silence, still forbidden (IN-16 01:46, 05:27): ambiguous fallback scope; a "shipped slice only" promise; an unmapped lookup code with no stated outcome; a rule sentence whose "it" or "that" has two antecedents (survey: 97 raw pts on one reading); an answer key that contradicts the written contract (wafer: 32.58 pts); a malformed line in a reference or lookup table with no stated outcome (caldermoor CM-A, test-depth 840adf9); [v3: section 8] a generator branch with no rule sentence (3f39299a, b625f36e, 8d3e20fb); an output convention (casing, bundle size, invocation flags) no file states (80877080, 8d3e20fb). (b) Allowed ONLY when one shipped fact determines the answer (0b) and EVIDENCE_MAP names it, otherwise forbidden: an undefined symbol (a config value defines it); an override using different vocabulary (a shipped mapping table settles it); a tie-break (equal instants, merged-account rows, zero-weight votes; a shipped separating case, and AL-27 05:38 then needs a planted tie and a mutant); flag-versus-date semantics (a separating record); a nullable output field (a shipped example plus a determinate null condition); a merge or alias source (a determinate register shows the row that wins).
