+16. **Scripts:** `python3 <KIT>/structure_qc.py BUNDLE`; then `instruction_qc.py`, `tests_qc.py`, `judge_qc.py` with the same arguments. Confirm script findings in source files. Read `Starter.md:33-68` and script headers.
